	"data": "<!-- scanner: tagged active/ongoing but not updated in 115d — review -->\n\nProject: Calcifer Voice Mode (DIY Stack)\n\nVision\nFull local-first voice interaction with Calcifer — no cloud dependency for STT or TTS. Phone calls from the car, room presence in the house, same Calcifer behind both. We own the entire pipeline.\n\nCurrent State\nClawdTalk free tier — connected and working as a quick proof-of-concept\nOpenClaw voice-call plugin — not yet installed (DIY path)\nNo DIY voice stack running…",
